<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Kavanagh et al. (2013) phalangeal Inhibitory Cascade & Hiscock et al. (2017) BMP-GDF5-Noggin synovial joint interzone segmentation — Code-to-model traceability: 68/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Functions compute dispersion and analytical cascade ratios (L36-119), but lack explicit equation-level docstrings cross-referencing Kavanagh et al. (2013) PNAS Figs. 1-3, Hiscock et al. (2017) Dev. Cell, Hartmann & Tabin (2001) Cell, Brunet et al. (1998) Science, and the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_018_joint_interzone_clefting.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py L36–L119: Brief docstrings without explicit paper figure/equation or Lean 4 theorem mappings <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45d4150/2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py#L36-L119>" ;
    pk:hasScore 6.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Kavanagh et al. (2013) phalangeal Inhibitory Cascade & Hiscock et al. (2017) BMP-GDF5-Noggin synovial joint interzone segmentation — Model fidelity to source: 58/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes the 2x2 GDF5-Noggin Turing dispersion relation (L36-62) and analytical Kavanagh et al. (2013) Inhibitory Cascade trajectory (L65-76), backed by 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_018_joint_interzone_clefting.lean`. However, `simulate_1d_joint_clefting` (L79-119) uses an analytical Gaussian profile rather than integrating a growing-domain 1D/2D BMP-GDF5-Noggin reaction-diffusion PDE with distal PFR-FGF gradient modulation and zero-diffusion (D_G = D_N = 0) ablation control." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py L79–L119: Uses analytical Gaussian profile instead of growing-domain 1D/2D reaction-diffusion PDE and omits D=0 control <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45d4150/2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py#L79-L119>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

